<title>UK: TENNIS-ZIMBABWE BEAT BRITAIN 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ZIMBABWE BEAT BRITAIN 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe won both reverse singles</p>
<p>to beat Britain 4-1 in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group</p>
<p>one second round tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Zimbabe names first):</p>
<p>Byron Black beat Jamie Delgado 6-0 6-0 6-2</p>
<p>Wayne Black beat Andrew Richardson 6-3 6-7 (5-7) 7-6 (7-2)</p>
